{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.poster.avif?t=1770183731\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.webm?t=1770183731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/b2d95da44b902ba8dc6b4ec904b8356f.mp4?t=1770183731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the onslaught of an endless horde of monsters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kill monsters, gather their eyes, improve yourself!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this roguelite survival game, all you can do is survive as long as you can. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources for level up current run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather credits in each run to buy upgrades and help the next survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A lot of Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Builds Every Run. Select from a variety of upgrades to create a unique and overpowered builds every run. You can be a summoner-Drone Operator, for example, and destroy monsters with drones, or ranged sniper who use electrobullets to pierce enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Select Your Hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse selection of characters and weapons that offer a variety of gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2192780/extras/50f8a4c0e2cd3e9ef3e01c6b2c2877bd.poster.avif?t=1770183731\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_